	(text "The Maximum Size of the Flash is: \"Up to 16 MB of external QSPI flash/PSRAM via dedicated QSPI bus\". So, the Flash Memory Options are:\n-> 16Mbit(2MB), in the \"-XL\" variant, i.e. W25Q16JVSSIQ.\n-> 128Mbit(16MB), in the \"-XXL\" variant, i.e. W25Q128JVSIQ."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
